# Every change to this repo requests a review from the owner automatically.
#
# CODEOWNERS is read from the DEFAULT branch (master), so this file only has
# any effect once it has been merged into master. Keeping it on staging too
# means it survives the next staging -> master merge.
#
# The master ruleset requires 1 approving review. GitHub never lets a PR author
# approve their own PR, so with only two people holding write access, @coy123
# is the only possible approver. This file just makes the review request
# automatic instead of something the author has to remember to add.
* @coy123
